        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joe Cornish, Steven Moffat, Edgar Wright, Adam McKay, Paul Rudd, Matt Besser, Amy Poehler, Ian Roberts, Matt Walsh, Rick Roman, Horatio Sanz, Drew Franklin\n- Organizations: NBC, Upright Citizens Brigade\n- Works: Ant-Man, The Kid Who Would Be King, Saturday Night Live\n\nFacts:\n- Adam McKay served as head writer for NBC's sketch comedy series Saturday Night Live for two seasons.\n- The original incarnation of Upright Citizens Brigade included Matt Besser, Amy Poehler, Ian Roberts, Matt Walsh, Adam McKay, Rick Roman, Horatio Sanz, and Drew Franklin, whose picture became the UCB logo.\n- Joe Cornish co-wrote Ant-Man with Edgar Wright, Adam McKay, and Paul Rudd.\n- Joe Cornish wrote and directed the upcoming British-American adventure drama film The Kid Who Would Be King.",
